    <string name="omnidroid_help_content"><![CDATA[
        <b>&#8226;How do I use Omnidroid?</b><br/>
        Copy all your ROMs files into a directory on your device and select it within Omnidroid. This directory is allowed to have subdirectories. After the scan completes you should see your games.<br/><br/>
        <b>&#8226;Why aren\'t my games detected?</b><br/>
        If your games are compressed, try uncompressing them. If this doesn\'t work try putting ROMs into separate directories, one for each system with the following names: $SYSTEMS.
    ]]></string>

